    "paragraph": "Comparative case studies in Favela Santa Marta and Vila Tronco document how residents deploy participatory practices to address transport injustices in Brazil. Research on Dar es Salaam's Bus Rapid Transit rollout uses interviews, field observations, document reviews, and stakeholder mapping to examine stakeholder involvement and governance power dynamics. Finally, an analysis of Landsat 8 satellite data from 2015 to 2024 evaluates surface albedo and land surface temperature across white-roof and brown-roof sample areas in five United States cities.",
